 "remarks": "Welcome to 76 New Canaan Avenue, Unit 7! This updated two-bedroom condo with loft offers a bright, open floor plan with hardwood floors throughout. The spacious kitchen features a large island, perfect for entertaining, while built-in cabinetry in the living room and laundry room provides added storage. Upstairs, the loft includes a flex room, walk-in closet, and additional storage. Additional features include in-unit laundry, elevator access, private storage, and two garage parking spaces. Conveniently located near I-95 and the Merritt Parkway, this home offers an easy commute.",
